\par }\pard \li284\nowidctlpar {\lang1033 I wrote MatFa's Boids 0.3
 during February 1997, 'cause it seemed the thing to do. It took all of two days to get running, but I knew the rules I needed in advance. My lacking memory of trigonometry caused a lot of those days to be spent hunting dumb bugs. A couple of more days we
re spent on making it look nicer, and writing this document, so I could release it into the public domain.
\par 
